Smoke tests for removed features and target-specific behavior

Verifies that features removed by Code Editor patches (SCM, merge conflict,
call hierarchy, etc.) are properly hidden. Guards web-embedded-only tests
with isWebEmbedded check. Enables terminal/task tests for reh-web builds.
